    <chapter title="Test Scenarios">
        <procedure title="Adds a Report Engine Setups" id="test-1">
            <p><b>Scenario:</b> Add Report Engine Setup</p>
            <p>Creates a new report engine setup with name, type, template, and result properties.</p>
            <step>1. Navigate to Report Engine Setups settings page. 2. Click the Add button. 3. Enter the report engine setup name. 4. Select a report type from the first dropdown. 5. Select a template from the second dropdown. 6. Open Result Properties and select a property. 7. Save the new setup.</step>
            <chapter title="Expected Results">
                <p>• A confirmation message "Report has been added" is displayed.</p>
            </chapter>
        </procedure>
